        "Description": "Four mercenaries, struggling to feed their families, secretly banded together to rob and sell weapon supplies each month. The heists went unnoticed, hidden behind their everyday lives, until one day, an innocent bystander snitched on them. What began as a desperate act to survive turned into a nightmare, leaving their families in great fear. Our client, furious at the theft of his crucial resource, wants to send a clear message.",
